---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Cookie Policy | Dongho Lee Real Estate"
  description="Cookie Policy for Dongho Lee Real Estate."
>
  <article class="legal-page">
    <header>
      <p class="page-kicker">Cookies</p>
      <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: September 8, 2026</p>
    </header>

    <div class="legal-content">
      <section>
        <h2>What Cookies Are</h2>
        <p>
          Cookies are small text files that may be stored on your device when you visit a website. They can help websites remember preferences, measure performance, and understand how visitors use the site.
        </p>
        <p><strong>한국어 안내:</strong> 쿠키는 웹사이트 방문 시 기기에 저장될 수 있는 작은 정보 파일입니다. 웹사이트 기능 유지, 방문 통계, 광고 및 동의 선택 관리에 사용될 수 있습니다.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>How This Website May Use Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          This website uses Google Analytics 4 to understand aggregate website usage, such as pages viewed, general traffic sources, and movement between donghotheagent.com and dongholee.ca. Google Analytics may use cookies or similar technologies to maintain a visit across these two related domains. This website does not use this analytics configuration to collect information submitted through contact forms.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Essential cookies or similar technologies needed for website hosting, security, and basic functionality.</li>
          <li>Google Analytics cookies or similar technologies that help us understand which pages are useful and preserve a visitor session between donghotheagent.com and dongholee.ca.</li>
          <li>Advertising cookies or similar technologies from Google AdSense and its advertising technology partners when ads are enabled and the relevant processing is permitted by law and your consent choices.</li>
          <li>Consent-management technologies that remember your privacy choices and, where applicable, communicate those choices to advertising partners.</li>
          <li>Third-party embedded content, if present, such as maps, videos, or external media.</li>
        </ul>
        <p><strong>한국어 안내:</strong> 이 사이트는 필수 기능, Google Analytics 분석, 광고가 활성화된 경우의 Google AdSense 광고, 동의 선택 저장, 제3자 임베드 기능을 위해 쿠키 또는 유사 기술을 사용할 수 있습니다.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Advertising And Google AdSense</h2>
        <p>When Google AdSense is active, Google and its advertising technology partners may use cookies or similar technologies to serve, measure, limit, and protect advertising. Depending on your location and choices, ads may be personalized, non-personalized, or limited. We use a Google-certified consent management platform for applicable consent messages.</p>
        <p><strong>한국어 안내:</strong> Google AdSense가 활성화되면 Google 및 광고 기술 파트너는 광고 제공·측정·제한·보호를 위해 쿠키 또는 유사 기술을 사용할 수 있습니다. 이용자의 위치와 선택에 따라 맞춤형, 비맞춤형 또는 제한된 광고가 표시될 수 있습니다.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 id="privacy-settings">Managing Cookies And Privacy Choices</h2>
        <p>
          You can control or delete cookies through your browser settings. Blocking some cookies may affect how certain website features work.
        </p>
        <p>Where our consent message is available, use the <button type="button" class="privacy-settings-link" data-privacy-settings>Privacy and cookie settings · 개인정보 및 쿠키 설정</button> control to review or withdraw advertising and cookie consent. If the consent manager is not available for your location, the control will direct you to this policy instead.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>
          Third-party services, including Google Analytics, Google AdSense, consent-management services, embedded media providers, hosting, security, and email delivery providers, may use their own cookies or tracking technologies according to their own policies. This website does not control those independent practices.
        </p>
        <p>For Google information, see <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">How Google uses information from sites and apps</a> and <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Questions</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about cookie use may be sent to <a href="mailto:contact@donlee.realtor">contact@donlee.realtor</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
